Delete the memory "{{fileId}}" from the vault.

Steps:
1. Call read_memory with file_id="{{fileId}}" to confirm it exists.
   If the memory is not found, stop and inform the user.
2. Call get_related_memories with file_id="{{fileId}}" to identify memories that link to it.
   Warn the user about any dangling wiki-links that will result from the deletion.
3. Ask for explicit confirmation before proceeding.
4. Call delete_memory with file_id="{{fileId}}".
5. Report the deletion result and list any memories that now have dangling links.
